<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He trod in old Judea</l><l>Life’s pathway long ago;</l><l>The people thronged about Him,</l><l>His saving grace to know.</l><l>He healed the broken-hearted,</l><l>And caused the blind to see;</l><l>And still His great heart yearneth</l><l>In love for even me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
